            <tr>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <num>
                        <t v="1."/>
                     </num>
                     <t v="A product comprised of dried, pre-cooked wheat flour noodles (approximately 80 g) and spices (approximately 11 g)."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="The product is put up for retail sale in a 250 ml expanded polystyrene bowl, which contains noodles and a small sachet of spices."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="According to the instructions printed on the packaging, the spices and boiling water (max 200 ml) have to be added to the bowl of noodles. After three minutes, the pasta is ready for consumption."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="(See photograph)"/>
                     <noteRef href="#note_3" marker="*"/>
                  </p>
               </td>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <t v="19023010"/>
                  </p>
               </td>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <t v="Classification is determined by General Rules 1, 3 (b) and 6 for the interpretation of the Combined Nomenclature, and by the wording of CN codes "/>
                     <t v="1902"/>
                     <t v=", "/>
                     <t v="190230"/>
                     <t v=" and "/>
                     <t v="19023010"/>
                     <t v="."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="The product is presented as a set, the components of which are put up for retail sale. The essential character of the product is given by noodles considering their large proportion."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="The product cannot be classified in heading "/>
                     <t v="2104"/>
                     <t v=" as the addition of the quantity of water into the bowl is not sufficient to prepare a soup or a broth but gives it the characteristics of a noodle dish."/>
                  </p>
               </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <num>
                        <t v="2."/>
                     </num>
                     <t v="Diuretic/renal tea put up in bags for retail sale."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="The label contains the following information:"/>
                  </p>
                  <list kind="arabic">
                     <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_1" kind="point">
                        <num>
                           <t v="1)"/>
                        </num>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Composition of each bag (1,8 g):"/>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Medicinally active ingredients:"/>
                        </p>
                        <list kind="definition">
                           <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_1/def_1" kind="definition">
                              <num>
                                 <t v="—"/>
                              </num>
                              <heading>
                                 <t v="horsetail"/>
                              </heading>
                              <p>
                                 <t v="0,47"/>
                                 <t v=" g"/>
                              </p>
                           </unit>
                           <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_1/def_2" kind="definition">
                              <num>
                                 <t v="—"/>
                              </num>
                              <heading>
                                 <t v="birch leaves"/>
                              </heading>
                              <p>
                                 <t v="0,45"/>
                                 <t v=" g"/>
                              </p>
                           </unit>
                           <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_1/def_3" kind="definition">
                              <num>
                                 <t v="—"/>
                              </num>
                              <heading>
                                 <t v="golden rod"/>
                              </heading>
                              <p>
                                 <t v="0,38"/>
                                 <t v=" g"/>
                              </p>
                           </unit>
                           <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_1/def_4" kind="definition">
                              <num>
                                 <t v="—"/>
                              </num>
                              <heading>
                                 <t v="spiny restharrow root"/>
                              </heading>
                              <p>
                                 <t v="0,20"/>
                                 <t v=" g"/>
                              </p>
                           </unit>
                        </list>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Other ingredients:"/>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Rose hip husks, cornflower leaves, peppermint leaves, marigold blossom, liquorice root."/>
                        </p>
                     </unit>
                     <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_2" kind="point">
                        <num>
                           <t v="2)"/>
                        </num>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Dosage and mode of application:"/>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Pour one cup (approximately 150 ml) of boiling water onto one tea bag, cover and leave to brew for approximately 15 minutes and then remove the tea bag. Unless otherwise prescribed, one cup of freshly brewed tea 3 to 4 times a day between meals."/>
                        </p>
                     </unit>
                     <unit eId="anx/tbl_1/tr_4/td_1/pnt_3" kind="point">
                        <num>
                           <t v="3)"/>
                        </num>
                        <p>
                           <t v="Applications:"/>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                           <t v="To increase the volume of urine in the case of kidney or bladder catarrh and to prevent urinary gravel or stones."/>
                        </p>
                     </unit>
                  </list>
               </td>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <t v="21069092"/>
                  </p>
               </td>
               <td>
                  <p>
                     <t v="Classification in accordance with General Rules 1 and 6 for the interpretation of the Combined Nomenclature, Additional Note 1 to Chapter 30, the description for CN codes "/>
                     <t v="2106"/>
                     <t v=", "/>
                     <t v="210690"/>
                     <t v=" and "/>
                     <t v="21069092"/>
                     <t v="."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="See also the HS Explanatory Notes to heading "/>
                     <t v="2106"/>
                     <t v=", paragraph 14 and the Combined Nomenclature Explanatory Notes to Chapter 30."/>
                  </p>
                  <p>
                     <t v="Neither the user directions nor packaging contain any details of the type and concentration of the active substance(s). They mention only the amount and type of plants or parts of plants used. The conditions of Additional Note 1(b) to Chapter 30 are not therefore met."/>
                  </p>
               </td>
            </tr>
